  "id": "USN-9109-1",
  "summary": "libapache-session-browseable-perl vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that Apache::Session::Browseable did not verify the\ncertificates of remote LDAP servers by default. A remote attacker could\npossibly use this issue to perform a machine-in-the-middle attack and\nobtain sensitive information. This update enables certificate verification\nby default and adds the ldapVerify, ldapCAFile, and ldapCAPath options.",
